OL,3,GNEWSA'We raised #26k in a week to fight
OL,4,Adevelopers'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith hundreds of thousands of new homes
OL,7,Fa year planned by the government, some
OL,8,Frural residents are going to new
OL,9,Flengths to protect their green fields.
OL,11,F"It's not enough these days to object
OL,12,Fbased on a lack of schools or a lack of
OL,13,Fdoctors surgeries - you've really got
OL,14,Fto get under the bonnet of development
OL,15,Fand planning law," said Martine
OL,16,FNaughton.
OL,18,FShe is the chair of Trull Parish
OL,19,FCouncil in Somerset, which recently
OL,20,Fraised more than #26,000 in six days
OL,21,Ffor barristers to represent them at a
OL,22,Fplanning appeal.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
