OL,3,GNEWSA'We raised #26k in a week to fight
OL,4,Adevelopers'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government and developers say there
OL,7,Fis a chronic shortage of housing. The
OL,8,Fnational backdrop is of a country where
OL,9,Fmillions of people are facing high
OL,10,Frents, long social housing waits or
OL,11,Fcannot afford to buy homes where they
OL,12,Fwant to live.
